<title>UK: Sachsen LB sets 1.0 bln mark bond due July 2003.</title>
<headline>Sachsen LB sets 1.0 bln mark bond due July 2003.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Commerzbank, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, DG Bank and Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SACHSEN LANDESBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.75	MATURITY    01.JUL.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.065    PAY DATE    20.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  27.5 BP   LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) ONE	 MGT/UND    6 BPSELL CONC   21.5 BP</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 90</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
